WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.721
A cycle ends. Start the next.

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:09.761
End a program and its cycle report opens. Records, ratios and bar speed.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.472
It names what limited you. Then it points to your next cycle.

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:17.998
Records and ratios, start against end.

00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:23.031
Barforge Weightlifting is free to download. Pro unlocks this.
